<http://data.silknow.org/object/938e004c-6090-342e-951e-9dce0ddd846c/observation/1>
        a                   crmsci:S4_Observation ;
        ecrm:P2_has_type    <http://data.silknow.org/observation/technical-observation> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note    "Textile of silk with a green satin  ground, brocaded in shades of pink, yellow, cream, dark green and blue silk and metal thread. \nIt is trimmed with a lace-pattern and a dense repeating pattern of semi- naturalistic flowers and leaves. Central  part of the design has large-scale  flowers and leaves in group one above  the other. On either side is a vertical reversed repeat with an undulating curve of a lace-type grid pattern and  flowers and leaves of different  dimensions."@en ;
        crmsci:O8_observed  <http://data.silknow.org/object/938e004c-6090-342e-951e-9dce0ddd846c> .

